    "description": "Tucked away at the end of a private cul-de-sac in the highly desirable Deer Creek Farm neighborhood, this exceptional property offers a rare combination of privacy, space, & peaceful country living. Surrounded by rolling hills & mature ponderosa pines, the home enjoys a picturesque setting with room to spread out. Offering more than 4,300 finished sq ft, this spacious home features 7 bedrooms & 4 bathrooms, providing exceptional flexibility for family, guests, or multi-generational living. At the heart of the home, the beautifully updated kitchen features granite countertops, a generous center island, stainless steel appliances, double ovens, & a gas cooktop, perfect for everyday living & entertaining. The spacious primary suite offers a private retreat complete with a cozy fireplace, oversized walk-in closet, & luxurious five-piece bath. The fully finished walkout basement expands the home's versatility with two additional bedrooms, a pellet stove, & a kitchenette, creating an ideal space for extended family, guests, or separate living quarters. Bring your RV, recreational vehicles, & hobbies! The oversized 933 sq ft attached garage, two storage sheds, & the 24' x 40' RV pad provide outstanding space for vehicles, storage, & workshop needs. There's even a chicken coop for those looking to enjoy a little backyard homesteading! Major improvements provide added peace of mind, including a new furnace, air conditioner, & roof, all replaced in 2025. Ideally situated between Parker & Elizabeth, & just six minutes from Singing Hills Elementary School. **Bonus Purchase**$50,000 Discount** The adjacent vacant 1.53 acre lot to the southeast is also available and currently listed at $175,000. Purchase this home and the vacant lot together and receive a $50,000 discount on the lot. 1.53 acres for just $125,000.  Address for the separately deeded lot is 41324 Pine Meadow Cir. Parker, CO. MLS #9504272.",
